            "value": "Een privé-samenvatting op je toestel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A professional helper can talk through sex, substances, sleep, PrEP, consent, and safety without judgment.": {
      "comment": "A description of the benefits of seeking support from a professional.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine professionelle Ansprechperson kann über Sex, Substanzen, Schlaf, PrEP, Einvernehmen und Sicherheit sprechen, ohne zu urteilen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A professional helper can talk through sex, substances, sleep, PrEP, consent, and safety without judgment."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un profesional de ayuda puede hablar sobre sexo, sustancias, sueño, PrEP, consentimiento y seguridad sin juzgar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un professionnel d'aide peut parler de sexe, de substances, de sommeil, de PrEP, de consentement et de sécurité sans juger."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een professionele hulpverlener kan praten over seks, middelen, slaap, PrEP, toestemming en veiligheid zonder oordeel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick look at the last 7 days, made for noticing patterns without judging yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein schneller Blick auf die letzten 7 Tage, um Muster zu erkennen, ohne dich zu verurteilen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un vistazo rápido a los últimos 7 días, pensado para notar patrones sin juzgarte."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un aperçu rapide des 7 derniers jours, conçu pour repérer des tendances sans te juger."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een snelle blik op de afgelopen 7 dagen, om patronen te zien zonder jezelf te beoordelen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet night is allowed to just be a quiet night.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein ruhiger Abend darf einfach ein ruhiger Abend sein."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una noche tranquila puede ser simplemente una noche tranquila."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une soirée calme a le droit d'être simplement une soirée calme."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een stille avond mag gewoon een stille avond zijn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet note from ChillMate": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
