            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een recente log heeft mogelijk snel seksueel-gezondheidsadvies nodig voor %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short plan helps: ending time, transport, medication check, substance limits, condoms/lube, emergency contact, and boundaries.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein kurzer Plan hilft: Endzeit, Transport, Medikamentencheck, Substanzgrenzen, Kondome/Gleitgel, Notfallkontakt und Grenzen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un plan breve ayuda: hora de finalización, transporte, control de medicación, límites de sustancias, condones/lubricante, contacto de emergencia y límites personales."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un plan court aide : heure de fin, transport, vérification des médicaments, limites de substances, préservatifs/lubrifiant, contact d'urgence et limites personnelles."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een kort plan helpt: eindtijd, vervoer, medicatiecheck, middelenlimieten, condooms/glijmiddel, noodcontact en grenzen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short rest can save a long recovery.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine kurze Pause kann eine lange Erholung ersparen."
