          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ketamine pushes blood pressure up and Kamagra pushes it down, and ketamine makes it hard to notice feeling faint. Stay seated if you feel your head go light.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ketamin treibt den Blutdruck hoch, Kamagra drückt ihn runter, und durch Ketamin merkst du schlecht, dass dir schwarz vor Augen wird. Bleib sitzen, wenn dein Kopf leicht wird."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ketamine pushes blood pressure up and Kamagra pushes it down, and ketamine makes it hard to notice feeling faint. Stay seated if you feel your head go light."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La ketamina sube la tensión y Kamagra la baja, y la ketamina hace difícil notar que estás a punto de desmayarte. Quédate sentado si sientes la cabeza ligera."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La kétamine fait monter la tension et le Kamagra la fait descendre, et la kétamine t'empêche de sentir que tu vas tourner de l'œil. Reste assis si ta tête devient légère."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ketamine duwt je bloeddruk omhoog en Kamagra duwt hem omlaag, en door ketamine merk je slecht dat je flauw dreigt te vallen. Blijf zitten als je hoofd licht wordt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ketamine raises blood pressure while Viagra lowers it, and ketamine makes it hard to tell how you are doing. Stay seated if you feel lightheaded.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ketamin erhöht den Blutdruck, Viagra senkt ihn, und durch Ketamin merkst du schlecht, wie es dir geht. Bleib sitzen, wenn dir schwindelig wird."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ketamine raises blood pressure while Viagra lowers it, and ketamine makes it hard to tell how you are doing. Stay seated if you feel lightheaded."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La ketamina sube la tensión mientras la Viagra la baja, y la ketamina hace difícil saber cómo estás. Quédate sentado si te mareas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La kétamine fait monter la tension pendant que le Viagra la fait baisser, et la kétamine t'empêche de bien sentir ton état. Reste assis si tu as la tête qui tourne."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ketamine verhoogt je bloeddruk terwijl Viagra hem verlaagt, en door ketamine merk je slecht hoe je eraan toe bent. Blijf zitten als je licht in je hoofd wordt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
