    "Out tonight? Tap if you want support, or let us know you’re safe.": {
      "comment": "\"Out tonight? Tap if you want support, or let us know you’re safe.\"",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Heute Abend unterwegs? Tippe, wenn du Unterstützung willst, oder sag uns, dass du sicher bist."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Out tonight? Tap if you want support, or let us know you’re safe."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¿Sales esta noche? Toca si quieres apoyo, o dinos que estás bien."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu sors ce soir ? Touche si tu veux du soutien, ou dis-nous que tu es en sécurité."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ben je vanavond uit? Tik als je steun wilt, of laat weten dat je veilig bent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Over a year of sustained recovery. Remarkable consistency.": {
