    "Slowing down does not mean you are missing the moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Langsamer zu werden heißt nicht, den Moment zu verpassen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ir más despacio no significa que te estés perdiendo el momento."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ralentir ne veut pas dire que tu rates l'instant."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vertragen betekent niet dat je het moment mist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowing down is a skill, and you are practicing it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Langsamer zu werden ist eine Fähigkeit, und du übst sie."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ir más despacio es una habilidad, y la estás practicando."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ralentir est une compétence, et tu l'exerces."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vertragen is een vaardigheid, en je oefent ermee."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowing the night down is rarely something you regret in the morning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den Abend zu entschleunigen bereut man morgens selten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ralentizar la noche rara vez es algo que lamentes por la mañana."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ralentir la soirée est rarement quelque chose que tu regrettes le matin."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De avond vertragen is zelden iets waar je 's ochtends spijt van hebt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowing your breathing tells your body it is safe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
