          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whatever today held, you are still here, and that counts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was der heutige Tag auch brachte, du bist noch da, und das zählt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sea lo que sea que trajo hoy, sigues aquí, y eso cuenta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quoi qu'ait apporté aujourd'hui, tu es toujours là, et ça compte."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wat vandaag ook bracht, je bent er nog, en dat telt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whatever you can manage today is allowed to be enough.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was auch immer du heute schaffst, es darf genug sein."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sea lo que sea que puedas hoy, puede ser suficiente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quoi que tu parviennes à faire aujourd'hui, ça a le droit de suffire."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wat je vandaag ook aankunt, het mag genoeg zijn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, all tracked Chills count toward the goal.": {
      "comment": "A description of the toggle that shows when it's off.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
